# Everything here runs on a Raspberry Pi, and is edited on Windows. Store and
# check out every text file with LF line endings, whatever core.autocrlf says
# on the machine doing the editing. A CRLF shell script fails on Linux with
# "$'\r': command not found", and a CRLF systemd unit or nginx config can fail
# in less obvious ways.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
